EmailTemplate.textOnly:
To {!advpm__Matter__c.advpm__Primary_Contact__c},

As we have not received a response on our previous attempts to contact you regarding payment options, we wanted to provide you with a settlement offer prior to incurring additional fees through litigation.

The current amount due on your loan is {!advpm__Matter__c.Outstanding_Balance__c}. At this time, we are able to offer you a ___% settlement in the amount of $ [REMAINING PRINCIPAL BALANCE + 5%] if paid within 10 days.

If you are unable to pay the above settlement amount, but still want to resolve prior to litigation, please reach out to us via phone or email.


Sincerely,


{!User.Name} | {!User.Title}

{!advpm__Matter__c.Email_Signature_Company__c}

{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}
{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}
P: {!User.Phone} | F: {!User.Fax}
E: {!User.Email}
